"type":"paragraph","text":"2部\n不等号(中田の)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番新しいけど結構好きな衣装！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2パターンあるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/18/4558742/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この衣装の好きなところは\nコンバースの可愛い靴なんだけど\n今日は履いてませんでした～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部\nポピパッパパー(まいまいの)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/18/4558742/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポピパッパパーは生写真以外で\n中田は着たこと無かったからレア！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも全部違うデザインで\n生写真では別のメンバーのを着たから\n本当に初めて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいのをお借りしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/18/4558742/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部\n今、話したい誰かがいる(中田の)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/18/4558742/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この衣装もメンバー分あるんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3パターンあって\nアクセサリーはいろんな種類あるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/18/4558742/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アクセサリーはまりちゃのお借りしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/18/4558742/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エコパ\n・せっかち\nのぎ天2\n沈黙の金曜日\n46時間TV\n・ナカダリズム\n・カナミン\n・琴子電視台\n・踊ってみた\n・人狼\